# GM-52 hosted smoke, manual version. The automated run is scripts/gm52_hosted_smoke.mjs.
# Use a hosted project (staging first). baseUrl is https://<ref>.supabase.co. Only the publishable key is used here:
# never paste a service_role or secret key into this file. Tokens come from step 1 and 2; delete the guests at the end.
@baseUrl = https://REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
@publishableKey = REPLACE_WITH_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
@hostToken = REPLACE_WITH_HOST_ACCESS_TOKEN
@memberToken = REPLACE_WITH_MEMBER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@roomId = REPLACE_WITH_ROOM_UUID

### 1. Auth is up and anonymous sign-in is on (HTTP 200 with access_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/signup
apikey: {{publishableKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"data":{"display_name":"GM52 host"}}

### 2. Catalogue reachable through REST (HTTP 200; keepalive uses this request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/dishes?select=id&limit=1
apikey: {{publishableKey}}

### 3. Create a lunch room as the host (HTTP 200, data.code six characters)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/dish_session
apikey: {{publishableKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"command":"create","payload":{"contractVersion":"dish-session-v4/roadmap-v2/GM-07.B-supplement","requestId":"gm52-create-1","displayName":"GM52 host","settings":{"dishCount":10,"mealSlot":"lunch","desiredAt":null},"preferences":{"cuisineIds":[],"categoryIds":[],"temperature":null,"flavor":null,"budget":null,"avoidRecent":false}}}

### 4. After one ballot and waiting, wait past 60 seconds with no worker running, then read the room
# Expect data.result or round 2, roster still two members (pg_cron job ie307-gm48-tick).
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/dish_session
apikey: {{publishableKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"command":"snapshot","payload":{"contractVersion":"dish-session-v4/roadmap-v2/GM-07.B-supplement","roomId":"{{roomId}}"}}

### 5. Public image bucket answers without a key once an image is uploaded (HTTP 200); the publishable key cannot upload (400/401/403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/storage/v1/object/public/dish-images/REPLACE_WITH_DISH_UUID.webp

### 6. Delete the host account (HTTP 200, data.deleted true); repeating the same requestId is acknowledged again
POST {{baseUrl}}/functions/v1/delete-account
apikey: {{publishableKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"REPLACE_WITH_A_NEW_UUID"}

### 7. The deleted token no longer works (401/403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/user
apikey: {{publishableKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
